---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy || Lawn Care & Pest Control Astro Theme" description="Learn how LawnPro & Pest collects, uses, stores, protects, and shares personal information when you visit the website or request services." wfPage="6aba295c0e791c71047d0ee6" footerTarget="d3d789c7-6eb1-a843-4e52-6d3e34e13d20">
    <div class="main">
      <section class="section bg-fantasy">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="privacy-hero-header">
              <h1 class="is-charcoal-black">Privacy Policy</h1>
              <p class="privacy-p">Last updated July  20, 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="privicy-main">
              <div class="privicy-info-group">
                <div class="privicy-title">Privacy at LawnPro</div>
                <p>This Privacy Policy details how LawnPro Lawn &amp; Pest (“we”, “us”) gathers, utilizes, and safeguards your personal information when you access our website or engage with our services. We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring your data is handled responsibly. By continuing to use our site, you consent to the practices outlined in this policy and acknowledge your understanding of how your information is managed.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="privicy-info-group">
                <div class="privicy-title">How we use your information</div>
                <p>We use your information to prepare and send detailed quotes, schedule and deliver the requested services, communicate with you regarding your account, process payments securely, and continuously improve our website and service offerings. We may send you service-related notifications and, only with your explicit consent, occasional marketing emails.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="privicy-info-group">
                <div class="privicy-title">How we share information</div>
                <p>We do not sell your personal information to any third parties. We share your data only with trusted service providers who assist us in operating our business — such as scheduling platforms, payment processors, and email services — and only to the extent necessary to deliver our services or comply with legal requirements.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="privicy-info-group">
                <div class="privicy-title">Data retention &amp; security</div>
                <p>We retain your information only as long as needed to provide our services and fulfill legal obligations. We employ reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to protect your data from unauthorized access, ensuring your information remains secure.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="privicy-info-group">
                <div class="privicy-title">Your choices &amp; rights</div>
                <p>You can unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time by clicking the link included in each message. You also have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information by contacting us at the address below.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="privicy-info-group">
                <div class="privicy-title">Contact us</div>
                <p>If you have any questions about this policy, please email us at privacy@evergreenlawn.com or call (843) 779-8873. Our team is happy to assist you.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
